requirements osha_penalties v1
description "Where the amounts of osha_penalty.rule come from: 29 CFR 1903.15(d), the section the rule pins."

role maintainer "Reads the section against the rule, and keeps the module"

source osha = rulec "osha_penalty.rule" source osha

scope rulec "osha_penalty.rule" table

requirement penalty_amounts
  text "For penalties proposed after January 15, 2025, the penalty for a willful violation is at least $11,823 and at most $165,514, and for a repeated violation at most $165,514. The penalty for a serious violation, an other-than-serious violation or a posting requirement violation is at most $16,550, and for a failure to correct a violation at most $16,550 per day."
  in force 2025-01-16..
  owner maintainer
  from @osha "§1903.15"
    reviewed 2026-11-05 by maintainer sha256:c2ef04d3f2d87924 -> sha256:791488765f4d15c2
  decided 2026-11-05 by maintainer "Follows the amendment at 90 FR 1861 (January 10, 2025), which states the adjusted amounts for penalties proposed after January 15, 2025."
  satisfied by rulec "osha_penalty.rule" table amounts
    reviewed 2026-11-05 by maintainer sha256:791488765f4d15c2 -> sha256:ef59be5c0a9bd563
  verified by rulec "osha_penalty.rule"
    reviewed 2026-11-05 by maintainer sha256:791488765f4d15c2 -> sha256:3ece81750c6fc1bb
